 "script": "Thanksgiving turkey, straight from the freezer, into the fryer. On the porch. What could go wrong?\n\nWhoa! Fire! Fire!\n\nMy eyebrows! And my porch!\n\nThanksgiving is the number one day of the year for home cooking fires.\n\nOne. Fry outside, far from the house, with the turkey fully thawed and dry.\n\nTwo. Small grease fire? Lid on, burner off. Never water. Anything bigger, get out and call nine one one.\n\nThree. After any fire damage, take photos and call your insurer before you throw anything out.\n\nIf Homie can figure it out, so can you.",
